<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Daling resigns as Gencor director.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Daling resigns as Gencor director.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanlam chairman Marinus Daling had resigned as a director of Gencor and had been appointed to the board of Genbel Securities (Gensec), according to a statement issued on Monday.</p>
<p>The insurance group said Daling had rearranged his directorships in order to pursue syngergies in the financial services companies within the Sanlam Group.</p>
<p>Daling recently left the Malbak group, which on Monday announced it had given the go-ahead for a full unbundling of the group.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
